bm?t=1749047183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059480/extras/05f60a84a3ce5c361e7b80b13d9482da.mp4?t=1749047183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059480/extras/f94aa9cb66b0a1e5bb885419db15c294.webp?t=1749047183\" /></div>Use your wits and your emotional intelligence to make the right decisions. Often there is more than one right answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059480/extras/5df1d63183a14574a735d4803508d881.poster.avif?t=1749047183\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059480/extras/5df1d63183a14574a735d4803508d881.webm?t=1749047183\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2059480/extras/5df1d63183a14574a735d4803508d881.mp4?t=1749047183\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
